    "$comment": "gpui's TextSystem panics when a probed family AND its fixed fallback stack (IBM Plex Sans, Lilex, Helvetica, Segoe UI, Ubuntu, Adwaita Sans, Cantarell, Noto Sans, DejaVu Sans, Arial) all fail to resolve; the painter probes `SF Mono`, `Menlo`… for generic mono names. The desktop dump therefore also loads the FIRST of these system families fontconfig finds (never used for a mapped family; cosmic-text may use it for glyphs the set lacks, as Chromium falls back to system fonts).",
